&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practical experience in launch vehicle development program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong practical experience with SolidWorks, Siemens NX or similar CAD software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
