Senior Product Manager &lt;p&gt;This is an&lt;strong&gt; initial 6-month&amp;nbsp;fixed-term&amp;nbsp;contract&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong&gt;those based in the UK&lt;/strong&gt; and authorised to work without sponsorship.&amp;nbsp;This position also&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;requires travel to client sites&lt;/strong&gt;, with travel expenses covered by the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nearform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nearform is an independent team of data &amp;amp; AI experts, engineers, and designers who build intelligent digital solutions and capability at pace. We create AI-enabled solutions that enhance digital experiences, empower developers, and deliver measurable results. In these ways, we partner with ambitious enterprises to deliver enduring impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our deep expertise in solving the world&#39;s most complex digital problems, along with our collaborative, people-first approach, enables enterprises to build breakthrough products and modernise legacy systems by unleashing the power of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, our team of 500 experts in 20+ countries is trusted by leading enterprises including Lululemon, Puma, Sun Life, Starbucks, Travelex, Virgin Media O2, and Walmart.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our Product function, our Senior Product Managers play a crucial role in translating business vision into successful digital products that drive enterprise success and enhance customer experiences. They define and execute product strategy, balancing high-level vision with hands-on operational execution. In a Product role at Nearform, you will collaborate closely with client stakeholders, engineers, and designers to uncover and define requirements, ensuring a deep understanding of user needs to shape the product roadmap. With a strong focus on strategy, communication, and delivery, you will guide teams in building impactful, scalable solutions that align with business goals and market demands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Senior Product Manager role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager, you will be a strategic visionary who oversees the development and execution of complex digital products. You&#39;ll collaborate closely with clients to define product vision, drive product strategy, translate goals into actionable roadmaps, and oversee the entire product lifecycle. Based on client goals, you will lead complex products and/or a portfolio of products. However, as you&#39;ll likely work on a variety of projects, your responsibilities may also include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business strategy into product strategy and execute that strategy in the delivery phase with the engineering team(s)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders to define the product roadmap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the ideation, development, and launch of features&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive action throughout the organisation to get products to market&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and carry out product launches, MVPs, and phased releases&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insight to stakeholders on the product, competitors, technical innovations, and market&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide product marketing with insights on key differentiators and messages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write requirements - typically as epics, features, and user stories — including clear acceptance criteria&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and adhere to Definition of Ready and Definition of Done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support grooming and refinement ceremonies in collaboration with Tech Leads to ensure alignment on the requirements and to support the delivery goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, document, and communicate risks, changes, or delays as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage all aspects of in-life products, including customer feedback, requirements, and issues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in daily scrum meetings, planning, reviews, demos, and retrospectives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with client teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience delivering at a senior level, including experience in defining product-level OKRs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will typically have at least 3 years&#39; experience delivering commercial impact at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in leveraging AI in day-to-day product operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable idea-to-launch product experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product-level ownership (not feature or journey level)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience delivering products in an agile environment, collaborating directly with engineers and designers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with early-stage products, new product development, and product modernisation from discovery to MVP launch and beyond&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to collaborate with senior stakeholders at various levels (C-Suite, VP, Director) and areas of the organisation, with differing business goals, to drive successful roadmaps and releases. You may have previously played a Head of Product or equivalent role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and troubleshooting skills, with product experience and mature judgement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to define and lead product discovery workshops to define customer journeys, deliver tangible roadmaps and a prioritised backlog, including test-and-learn and A/B testing methodologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in delivering business and customer outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Call&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(30 mins via Zoom)&lt;br&gt;An introductory conversation with a member of our Talent Team to learn more about your background, experience, and career goals. We&#39;ll also provide a high-level overview of Nearform and answer any questions you may have. This step helps us assess initial alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Interview&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;(1 hour via Zoom)&lt;br&gt;An in-depth discussion with up to two of our trained Product Management interviewers to find out more about your experience, your preferred ways of working, and how you would solve some of the problems our Senior Product Managers face when dealing with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Case Study&lt;/strong&gt; (1 hour via Zoom)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;As the final step, you&#39;ll complete a short product case study and present your recommendation during the interview, followed by questions and discussion. The call will focus on your product thinking, decision-making, and ability to work through assumptions and unknowns. We&#39;ll also share more details about Nearform and the potential projects you may join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;There may also be an additional interview with the client depending on the project&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about building high-quality applications, solving complex challenges, and driving innovation in enterprise development, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Apply now via our careers page at Nearform and be part of a team that values technical excellence, collaboration, and continuous learning.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nearform is committed to shaping a better world in all that we do. Our global team is built on respect, inclusivity, diversity, and excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you require any adjustments to the interview process as part of your application, please let someone from our Talent Team know so they can help.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our&lt;strong&gt; salary range starts at&amp;nbsp;£85,000 &lt;/strong&gt;+ benefits. Further details will be discussed in the initial interview, and final compensation will be determined based on skills, experience, and other job-related factors discussed during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Product & Project

Healthcare & Life Sciences Principal, EMEA &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Principal of Business Development for Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences for EMEA, you will drive the strategy, financial performance, and growth of our core Healthcare and Life Sciences segments. Whether focused on Providers, Payers, or Life Sciences, you will serve as the General Manager for your vertical by owning the booking targets and orchestrating strategic vertical alliances. You will accelerate our market momentum by architecting and executing high-impact, joint go-to-market (GTM) strategies with our top-tier resellers and hyperscaler partners across EMEA.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will bridge the gap between technical innovation and market needs. You will determine objectives to address critical industry challenges including digital transformation, AI adoption, and cloud migration and act as a principal advisor to both our internal teams and external customers. This role differentiates itself by shifting the traditional partner relationship into a true co-selling engine, directly driving pipeline and bookings for HLS solutions via Partner-Sourced business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Pipeline &amp;amp; Financial Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the booking targets and financial performance for the segment by developing and executing a multi year strategic growth plan. Drive and scale the overarching pipeline and bookings targets across the EMEA ecosystem, establishing clear qualification criteria and pipeline visibility.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the EMEA Value Proposition:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Define and articulate the value proposition for Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences to drive growth and establish Everpure as the industry leader.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Execute Joint GTM Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and launch strategic go-to-market plans with priority partners, aligning internal cross-functional EMEA teams (Partner Account Teams, Core Sales, Alliances, Marketing) to unlock high-potential HLS customer accounts and activate new revenue streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Strategic Alliances:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Orchestrate strategic vertical alliances and operationalize relationships with key partners to secure reference architectures and joint go to market motions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable and Mobilize the Partner Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip sales teams and partners with the specialized tools, training, and playbooks they need to successfully position and sell vertical solutions. Train and align Partner representatives ensuring they can effectively articulate our value proposition, economic differentiation, and technical sizing for healthcare compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Joint Demand Gen &amp;amp; Thought Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Act as a spokesperson for your vertical vision in customer meetings, industry events, analyst briefings, and media opportunities. Build credibility as a principal advisor by shaping the industry narrative around intelligent data foundations and enterprise AI adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HLS &amp;amp; Alliance Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success leading strategic business development or alliance management within the technology sector, with a deep understanding of customers solutions, cloud economics, and the specific regulatory, data, and compliance needs of the EMEA Healthcare and Life Sciences sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute the global strategy for your segment in partnership with Product Management, Sales, and Engineering teams. A track record of balancing high-level strategy with a &quot;roll-up-your-sleeves&quot; execution mindset, showing a strong ability to build trust and influence executive leaders across partner organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding business acumen and communication skills, with a collaborative approach to thriving in a fast-paced, cross-functional, and multi-cultural EMEA environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; We operate in a hybrid/field-based model. You will be expected to work effectively from a regional corporate office in a key EMEA market, with the ability to travel 25–40% across the region as business needs require.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://purebenefits.com&quot;&gt;purebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Sales

